himps is a VR experience built around a 1:1 physics-based locomotion system. You move by pushing off surfaces and grabbing onto the world. There are no thumbstick movements or button-based jumping. Everything depends on your physical input and momentum. \n\nFeatures include: \n\n1) Entirely hand-driven physics movement. \n\n2) Multiplayer rooms. \n\n3) In-game computer terminals for changing your name and color. \n4) A social sandbox environment for hanging out and having fun.\n\nThere are no external menus. Everything is handled within the game world for maximum immersion.", "short_description": "Physics-driven movement and social sandbox. A VR experience focused on momentum and skill. Use your hands to interact with the environment\u2014climb, jump, and swing through the map. Join multiplayer rooms and customize your character through in-game terminals."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/amazing-chimps-privacy-notice/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RIPTIDE_GTVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/amazing-chimps-privacy-notice/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "27117285341294382"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1534116378147827"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1534116378147827"}, "is_app